    <item>
      <title>Warmth Opens the Door. It Doesn't Keep It Open.</title>
      <link>https://www.showmereceipts.org/field-notes/warmth-opens-the-door.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.showmereceipts.org/field-notes/warmth-opens-the-door.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>Field Note</category>
      <description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.showmereceipts.org/images/notes/field-note.png&quot; width=&quot;32&quot; height=&quot;32&quot; alt=&quot;Field Note&quot;&gt; Why "fundraising is about relationships" stops one step too early. The working alliance research found that warmth predicts whether help begins. The institutional record is what determines whether it lasts.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
