      <description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.showmereceipts.org/images/notes/field-note.png&quot; width=&quot;32&quot; height=&quot;32&quot; alt=&quot;Field Note&quot;&gt; A bird that sounds like a car alarm and a siren with responders on the way. One story lands. The other one works.</description>
