    <item>
      <title>The Windmill and the Ask</title>
      <link>https://www.showmereceipts.org/field-notes/the-windmill-and-the-ask.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.showmereceipts.org/field-notes/the-windmill-and-the-ask.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>Field Note</category>
      <description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.showmereceipts.org/images/notes/field-note.png&quot; width=&quot;32&quot; height=&quot;32&quot; alt=&quot;Field Note&quot;&gt; A wind turbine does not make the wind. A good ask does not make the donor’s motivation either. It stands where that motivation already moves.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>The Second Draw</title>
      <link>https://www.showmereceipts.org/field-notes/the-second-draw.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.showmereceipts.org/field-notes/the-second-draw.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>Field Note</category>
      <description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.showmereceipts.org/images/notes/field-note.png&quot; width=&quot;32&quot; height=&quot;32&quot; alt=&quot;Field Note&quot;&gt; Two blood draws, two hours apart, looked redundant. They were the only way to know nothing was happening, and someone made room to find out.</description>
