    <item>
      <title>The Most Skeptical Donors Gave the Most</title>
      <link>https://www.showmereceipts.org/field-notes/the-most-skeptical-donors-gave-the-most.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.showmereceipts.org/field-notes/the-most-skeptical-donors-gave-the-most.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>Field Note</category>
      <description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.showmereceipts.org/images/notes/field-note.png&quot; width=&quot;32&quot; height=&quot;32&quot; alt=&quot;Field Note&quot;&gt; A headline said connection beats trust. The donors who trusted charities least gave the most, and that tells us which trust matters.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
