      <category>Field Note</category>
      <description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.showmereceipts.org/images/notes/field-note.png&quot; width=&quot;32&quot; height=&quot;32&quot; alt=&quot;Field Note&quot;&gt; A car show and an air show are poor fundraisers. Their real yield is the community they gather, a crowd of strangers who turn out to be a flock.</description>
